  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8. Waterford 3&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Security employees are represented by the International Union, Security, Police and Fire Professionals of America, Local Union 709. The Company and the Union agreed to a contract effective May 1, 2022 through April 30, 2026. The Company and the Union agreed to a new contract effective January 1, 2026 through December 31, 2029. Effective January 1, 2026, the wage increase was 3.5%.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
